{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797300/extras/DiceyWords_Title_01.gif?t=1749513777\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dicey Words is a dice-based word-building roguelike where strategy, vocabulary, and a little luck collide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Roll letter dice, lock and reroll like Yahtzee, and craft five-letter words for big points. Every decision matters\u2014what letters you keep, what words you build, and how you use the powerful badges you earn along the way. Each run is a fresh challenge packed with risk, reward, and ever-evolving mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797300/extras/Show_Badge_01.gif?t=1749513777\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The ultimate word-based roguelike.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Think fast, spell smart\u2014every roll is a puzzle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your loadout with over <strong>48 unique badges</strong> that bend the rules, boost your score, or twist the way dice behave.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take on <strong>12 challenging bosses</strong> across <strong>7 levels of difficulty</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trade letters for permanent perks with a unique letter sacrifice system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover <strong>6 specialized dice types</strong> that add layers of strategy to every roll.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your runs with <strong>13 powerful perks</strong> to build your perfect word engine.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you're a word game fanatic or a roguelike addict, <strong>Dicey Words</strong> delivers fast-paced, brain-twisting gameplay with 